WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.460
It’s Halloween night in Chicago.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:08.480
The stores along Main Avenue are leaving out
bowls of candy for the evening’s trick or

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.480
treaters.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.769
Streets are closed off for the big parade
downtown, and young children are running home

00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:16.980
from school to jump into their favorite costumes.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:22.160
It’s a night of harmless, spooky fun for
most - But not everyone.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:27.800
A police cruiser pulled up outside an apartment
building on Kenmore Ave, overlooking the Graceland

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.800
Cemetery.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.180
A pair of seasoned officers climbed out and
made their way up to the thirteenth floor.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.890
There had been multiple reports of terrified
screaming echoing through the building throughout

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:38.890
the night.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:42.110
Was someone getting a little too into the
Halloween spirit and watching a horror movie

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:47.100
at earsplitting volume, or was this something
altogether more sinister?

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:52.840
The police officers approached the door of
apartment 1330B and rapped on the hardwood.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.379
“Ma’am, is everything okay in there?”

00:00:55.379 --> 00:00:56.379
No reply.

00:00:56.379 --> 00:00:59.199
They repeated themselves, a little louder
this time.

00:00:59.199 --> 00:01:04.250
They could hear movement from within, but
still, no answer came.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:07.640
That was enough probable cause for them to
kick in the front door.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:12.870
The officers swept the apartment, going room
to room, hands hovering above their holsters.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.540
Kitchen: Nothing.

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.210
Bedroom: Nothing.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:19.729
But the living room was a whole different
horror story.

00:01:19.729 --> 00:01:25.280
To their utter disbelief, a human skeleton
was standing in front of them, holding a swathe

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:29.630
of flayed human skin, still dripping with
fresh blood.

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:34.759
The skeleton was forcing one of its legs into
the bloody sack, as though it was slipping

00:01:34.759 --> 00:01:37.170
on a Halloween costume.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:42.000
On the floor nearby, a pile of human bones
sat atop mangled flesh.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.450
The officers gasped at the sight and the skeleton
turned to face them.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:51.040
Without hesitation, it dropped the flayed
skin and lunged, wrapping its icy fingers

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:52.659
around their throats.

00:01:52.659 --> 00:01:58.640
The rest was a cacophony of screams and gunshots,
which soon gurgled and choked into a terrible

00:01:58.640 --> 00:01:59.640
silence.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:04.439
An hour later, a team of forensic specialists
cordoned off the area while another officer

00:02:04.439 --> 00:02:06.259
photographed the crime scene.

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:11.020
A pair of detectives paced around the apartment,
trying to piece together what happened.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:16.330
A pair of armed, well-trained officers, strangled
with such force that their necks snapped,

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:21.610
and across from them was a pile of bloody
bones, meat, and human skin.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:26.700
Before the detectives had time to draw any
conclusions, a group of black-suited FBI agents

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.110
arrived and ordered the local cops to vacate
the area.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.640
They were taking over the investigation now.

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:37.330
Don’t worry, these weren’t agents from
the Unusual Incidents Unit here to bungle

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.840
this case further.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:44.870
They were SCP Foundation field agents, undercover
and actively searching for a certain ornery

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:53.490
bag of bones: SCP-3114, a skeleton that the
adjectives “spooky” and “scary” don’t

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:55.010
even begin to cover.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:59.750
But first, a question: Wouldn’t it be chilly
to have no skin on?

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:04.230
It’s an old nursery rhyme that you might’ve
heard during your childhood, and if you ask

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:09.340
our professional opinion here at SCP Explained,
we’d say yes, it would be.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:13.750
And SCP-3114 can confirm this from first-hand
experience.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:20.160
That’s why, if ever you run into it, it
may leave the encounter wearing your skin.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:26.710
That’s right, SCP-3114 is a skeleton so
desperate to be just like us, it’s willing

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:32.620
to skin any human it meets and wear our bloody
pelts like a Halloween costume.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:38.610
This probably leaves you with a very understandable
question: So, what’s his whole deal?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.400
And thankfully, we have at least some of the
answers to that.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:48.090
After conducting a series of cognitive tests
on the anomaly, Foundation researchers concluded

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:54.340
that SCP-3114 responds primarily to visual
stimuli, with its other senses ranging from

00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:55.480
muted to non-existent.

00:03:55.480 --> 00:04:02.190
If something even vaguely humanoid enters
its line of sight, 3114 will enter its rage

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:07.100
state, making a beeline for the victim and
strangling them to death.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:12.010
Researchers believe 3114 chooses strangulation
as its favored murder method because it leaves

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:16.489
the skin intact, aside from a few minor bruises
and abrasions.

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:21.810
And once the victim is dead, it will begin
meticulously cutting them open and removing

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:28.610
their bones, again trying its best to do as
little damage to the skin as possible.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:33.310
SCP-3114 will then attempt to wear the skin
as its own, eventually discarding it after

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:34.650
wear and tear sets in.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:44.240
In one interaction, subject D-1724, an adult
male, entered SCP-3114’s containment chamber.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:49.560
SCP-3114 attacked him, reacting with an increased
level of aggression when the man tried to

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:51.340
fight back.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:57.860
SCP-3114 damaged the body of D-1724 to the
point that halfway through removing his bones,

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.400
it decided that even the skin was beyond salvaging.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:07.600
It discarded the body in a corner of its enclosure,
placing sticks and boxes over it in what researchers

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:10.730
believe to be a form of pseudo-burial.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:16.010
Tests on SCP-3114’s physical makeup indicate
that it is stronger and more resilient than

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:21.820
a normal human skeleton, owing to it being
made from a far denser material than non-anomalous

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:23.570
human bones.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:28.610
During tests, researchers attacked the bones
with sledgehammers, power tools, and other

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:34.030
means of exterior impact, concluding that
it took up to three times more force to break

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:38.710
one of the anomaly’s bones than those of
a normal person.

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:44.990
SCP-3114 also has regenerative healing properties,
being able to mend broken bones at shocking

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:48.780
speeds, making the creature effectively immortal.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:54.700
Even though SCP-3114 has no musculature or
connective tissue of any kind, its skeleton

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:58.320
is still somehow able to support itself and
move independently.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:03.720
When a bone is removed or pulled away from
its place, it will quickly return to its original

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:07.060
position once a force is no longer acting
on it.

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:13.480
It also has far greater speed and strength
than your average, non-anomalous human, despite

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.130
its lack of muscles.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:18.990
SCP-3114 also seems to have some semblance
of intelligence.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:24.290
As an extension of its drive to appear more
human, it even has periods of dormancy where

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.840
it mimics human sleep.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:32.740
Researchers have placed multiple items in
SCP-3114’s enclosure to observe how it reacts.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:37.220
These items have included sticks, boxes, tires,
and building blocks.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:42.920
A few experiments even involved placing live
subjects into its enclosure, often with predictably

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.660
violent results.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:50.700
Due to the danger of being in proximity of
SCP-3114, Foundation researchers use projections

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:57.340
of humans to lure it into a smaller secondary
containment cell adjacent to its primary enclosure.

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:02.740
Foundation staff are barred from entry until
SCP-3114 has been locked in this secondary

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.740
cell.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:07.530
Only then can items be added or removed from
the habitat.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:12.840
Mess this up, and you’re all but guaranteed
a closed-casket funeral.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:17.600
Something this strong and aggressive can create
considerable containment challenges for the

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:23.560
Foundation, so they started exploring a new
question: What can pacify this walking skeleton’s

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:24.720
homicidal wrath?

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:27.220
Two things, as it turns out.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:31.090
The first is finding a skin that fits just
right.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:36.180
Researchers placed a freshly deceased male
cadaver into SCP-3114's enclosure.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:42.710
Naturally, SCP-3114 began to systematically
remove the bones of the cadaver one by one,

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:46.930
then placed the skin of the corpse over its
own skeletal frame.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:53.070
SCP-3114 seemed happy with its new skin, observing
itself in a mirror.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:57.940
SCP-3114 studied the reflection from different
angles, attempting to smile with its sagging

00:07:57.940 --> 00:08:03.820
face and mimicking hand gestures one might
see in common social situations.

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:10.210
Intrigued by this development, researchers
sent D-4843 into the chamber to interact directly

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.600
with SCP-3114.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:19.260
Upon coming face to face with SCP-3114 wearing
decaying human skin, the human subject became

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:23.900
terrified and attempted to leave the enclosure.

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:28.650
SCP-3114 persisted in trying to interact with
the D-Class, attempting a handshake and even

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:35.789
caressing the D-4843’s face, its stolen
skin sculpted into an unflinching smile.

00:08:35.789 --> 00:08:38.169
The D-Class was not charmed by this.

00:08:38.169 --> 00:08:43.640
Instead, he wet himself and was allowed to
leave the enclosure to change his underwear.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:48.940
SCP-3114 seemed confused by the subject’s
fear and subsequent departure, waiting by

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.440
the door for him to come back.

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:55.740
It then grew frustrated and looked at itself
in the mirror again, this time reacting angrily,

00:08:55.740 --> 00:09:01.570
and violently tearing off its skin, perhaps
made self-conscious by the D-Class’ reaction

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.300
to its new face.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:09.200
From that encounter, researchers concluded
that SCP-3114 would not immediately attack

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:12.600
if it was wearing a skin that it deemed suitable.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:18.870
The second thing that calms this bag of bones
is the companionship of man’s best friend:

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:23.400
That’s right, SCP-3114 has a proclivity
towards dogs.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:28.060
This was discovered in a series of experiments
where the Foundation cross-tested the anomaly

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.440
with a variety of animal specimens.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:33.080
The first of these animals was a gorilla.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:38.320
SCP-3114 appeared to exhibit some hesitation
at first, indicating a level of recognition

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:42.390
between humans and our not-so-distant evolutionary
cousins.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:47.270
But unfortunately, the confrontation ended
violently when the gorilla became agitated

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:51.550
and tried to exert its dominance over SCP-3114.

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:55.800
This led to a physical altercation where the
gorilla was overpowered and killed, though

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:59.670
not without breaking one of SCP-3114’s ribs,
first.

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:05.290
Thankfully, the second attempt at animal interaction
- this time with a Border Collie - went much

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.430
smoother.

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:10.580
SCP-3114 took care to be gentle when playing
with and petting the dog.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:16.420
And even when the dog attempted to bite one
of its leg bones, SCP-3114 did not react in

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.720
an exceptionally violent manner.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:23.800
The pair spent the better part of two hours
together, playing fetch and seeming to enjoy

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:25.170
each other’s company.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:29.600
It’s comforting to know that there are at
least some things capable of temporarily taming

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.610
this stack of murderous calcium.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:35.040
But what happens when it breaches containment?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:38.000
This brings us back to our Halloween crime
scene.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:43.430
An embedded field agent in the FBI introduced
himself as Special Agent Thomas Seward.

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:48.550
He spoke to the local detectives on the scene,
showing them a badge they didn’t recognize

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:53.120
and asking them to come downstairs to a mobile
office outside the building, where they would

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:54.650
be debriefed.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:58.440
Members of Mobile Task Force Gamma-5, also
known as the “Red Herrings”,

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:03.550
were waiting in this unit to administer amnestics
to any members of local law enforcement who

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.300
knew about the case.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:09.300
They would later also canvass the building
for other witnesses and make arrangements

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:13.660
to ensure that the bodycam footage of the
two fallen officers would be destroyed.

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:20.600
It was unclear exactly how SCP-3114 escaped
containment, but recapturing the subject for

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:24.970
the safety of the local population remained
of paramount importance.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:31.390
With this goal in mind, agent Seward mobilized
MTF-Pi 1, also known as the City-Slickers.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:36.279
A Mobile Task Force that specializes in the
investigation, containment, and subsequent

00:11:36.279 --> 00:11:40.720
cleanup of anomalies in densely-populated
urban environments.

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:45.430
Under the guise of the FBI, the Pi-1 members
spread out across the streets of Chicago in

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:50.779
black vehicles, monitoring police scanners
for reports or sightings of walking skeletons

00:11:50.779 --> 00:11:52.990
attacking the civilian population.

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:59.920
Meanwhile, several blocks away, SCP-3114 found
itself walking past a row of clothing stores.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:04.620
It stopped at the sight of a mannequin modeling
sportswear in a window display.

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:10.230
Instead of charging at the humanoid figure
with lethal intent, SCP-3114 calmly walked

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.920
into the store and approached the mannequin.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:18.660
It began to study the figure, taking off its
clothes and trying them on, piece by piece.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.490
When it was fully clothed, it assumed the
mannequin’s pose.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:25.860
It then began to observe itself in a nearby
mirror with rapt fascination.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:30.959
A store clerk emerged from the backroom, noticing
that someone was trying on clothes outside

00:12:30.959 --> 00:12:32.450
of the changing room.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:36.130
He walked over to offer assistance but was
stopped in his tracks at the sight of this

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:40.690
strange new “customer” and the turn of
his bleached-white skull.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:45.910
Not long after that, the anomaly left the
store, wearing the clerk’s skin.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:52.149
As it emerged onto the streets, unnoticed
amidst the throng of trick or treaters, SCP-3114

00:12:52.149 --> 00:12:53.839
took in its surroundings.

00:12:53.839 --> 00:12:56.980
What a strange new world it’d found itself
in.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:03.500
Then, it spotted a nearby group of trick-or-treaters
wearing various costumes, most notably a plastic

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:04.529
skull mask.

00:13:04.529 --> 00:13:08.840
SCP-3114 had found its people.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:14.770
Excited by the prospect of another walking
skeleton, SCP-3114 decided to follow the group

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:20.290
as they sauntered over to a larger crowd gathering
on the main avenue for the annual Halloween

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.290
parade.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:27.080
Among the many participants dressed as werewolves
and vampires and other classic Halloween creatures,

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:33.850
SCP-3114 noticed a group of paraders dressed
as skeletons, dancing and walking together.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:38.130
People were cheering them on, taking photos,
and smiling at the spectacle.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.899
Perhaps it wasn’t so bad to be a bone-man
after all.

00:13:40.899 --> 00:13:44.080
And everyone else at the parade had their
eyes on SCP-3114.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:49.810
They didn’t see it as a violent anomalous
skeleton wearing skin stolen from an innocent

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:54.980
store clerk, they saw it as one of the most
brilliantly realistic costumes the parade

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.390
had ever seen.

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.130
People stared and waved and smiled in awe.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.550
And SCP-3114 was loving every bit of the attention.

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:09.910
Soon enough, SCP-3114 was leading the parade,
waving gleefully at the crowds of impressed

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:10.910
trick or treaters.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:15.290
It walked with the others for several blocks,
occasionally picking up fallen candy to throw

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.290
at the crowd.

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.290
“Wow!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.290
Great costume!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.290
That looks super real, mister!”

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.890
called a nearby 8-year-old boy marveling up
at SCP-3114.

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:24.350
“Do you want to come trick-or-treating with
us?”

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:28.630
He motioned to a group of 3 costumed friends
- they were all dressed as members of the

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.020
Avengers.

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:36.160
SCP-3114 turned its bony head, draped in stolen
skin, and followed the eager kids as they

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:40.339
began walking from house to house, asking
for Halloween treats.

00:14:40.339 --> 00:14:46.250
Watching the children stick out their bags
and plastic pumpkins, asking for candy, SCP-3114

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:48.180
began mimicking the behavior.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:51.110
It even picked up and started to carry its
own plastic pumpkin.

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:55.700
Meanwhile, across town, Agent Thomas Seward
was notified about a pile of bloody bones

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.110
found behind a counter in an up-market clothing
store.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:05.120
Only one creature in town tonight could be
behind that: SCP-3114.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:09.740
Seward made a call to all available Gamma-5
members, requesting a clean-up on-site and

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:13.820
comprehensive amnestic treatment for all witnesses
at the crime scene.

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:17.680
Seward and his team hit the bricks, searching
the surrounding area.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:23.340
He noticed the large crowds leaving the parade,
with some adolescents marveling at the “amazing

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:26.839
costume that zombie-looking guy was wearing.”

00:15:26.839 --> 00:15:29.010
And at that moment, it all came together for
Agent Seward.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:33.810
“What better place for a monster wearing
human skin to hide than in plain sight on

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:38.240
Halloween,”, he mused to himself while unclipping
his radio from his jacket.

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:43.279
Seward ordered all available agents to converge
on the main avenue and search any trick-or-treaters

00:15:43.279 --> 00:15:46.660
wearing any costumes that looked like rotting
human skin.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:52.260
They were on the clock: If they didn’t get
to SCP-3114 before its current skin suit degraded

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.410
fully, it would claim another life tonight.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:16:01.040
Meanwhile, SCP-3114 itself continued its night
out in public, trick-or-treating with the

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:05.810
group of children who were blissfully unaware
of how much danger they were in.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:09.950
As they went home to home, the creature’s
costume started to take on a pallid green

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:12.149
complexion as the rot set in.

00:16:12.149 --> 00:16:15.000
It gave off the most repulsive smell.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:18.019
At some point, flies even began to gather
around it.

00:16:18.019 --> 00:16:22.930
To any ignorant passerby, it was still the
most horrifying and brilliant costume they’d

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:23.930
ever seen.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:27.640
And whoever was wearing it must have been
so committed to the character, because they

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.320
never said a word.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.940
As the night wore on, the children each got
calls from their mothers, telling them it

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.720
was time to come home.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:39.430
After all the obligatory grumbles, they gave
in and did so, wishing their strange, silent

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:43.820
friend in the horrifying zombie costume a
Happy Halloween.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:49.870
This left SCP-3114 adrift, wandering around,
not sure exactly what to do with itself.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.029
Perhaps it was time to find a new skin.

00:16:52.029 --> 00:16:54.940
Maybe then, people would want to hang out
with it again…

00:16:54.940 --> 00:17:00.480
The anomaly was distracted from its dangerous
thoughts by a dog barking on a nearby lawn.

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:05.839
SCP-3114 was delighted to find another four-legged
friend out here in the wild, and approached

00:17:05.839 --> 00:17:08.909
to pet the tiny creature as it wagged its
little tail.

00:17:08.909 --> 00:17:12.199
How nice it felt to have a familiar comfort
again.

00:17:12.199 --> 00:17:16.110
That’s when it noticed one more little boy
wandering the lonely streets.

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.379
A new friend, perhaps?

00:17:18.379 --> 00:17:21.079
SCP-3114 would follow him and see…

00:17:21.079 --> 00:17:26.289
Just a few blocks down, SCP agents scoured
the streets with flashlights asking, anyone

00:17:26.289 --> 00:17:31.049
they could if they’d seen someone wearing
an eerily realistic costume, with little in

00:17:31.049 --> 00:17:33.049
the way of success.

00:17:33.049 --> 00:17:37.159
Agent Seward was in the middle of questioning
a man who had participated in the parade earlier

00:17:37.159 --> 00:17:41.109
that night when he got a phone call from one
of his subordinates.

00:17:41.109 --> 00:17:45.610
Listening to police scanners, agents had intercepted
a call coming from a terrified mother who

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:51.090
claimed that a grown man in a strange costume
had followed her little boy home.

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:55.299
The agents immediately made their way to the
address, making sure local police were notified

00:17:55.299 --> 00:17:57.289
not to respond to the call.

00:17:57.289 --> 00:18:02.909
Upon arrival, they found that SCP-3114 had
broken into the family’s living room, and

00:18:02.909 --> 00:18:04.799
was petting the family’s dog.

00:18:04.799 --> 00:18:09.190
The skinsuit had almost fully degraded now,
hanging off the monster’s body like rotten

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.190
baloney.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:12.399
They didn’t have much time.

00:18:12.399 --> 00:18:16.590
Agent Seward had his men surround the building
as a containment vehicle backed up towards

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.590
the home.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:22.429
They couldn’t engage SCP-3114 directly without
the risk of a fatality.

00:18:22.429 --> 00:18:26.809
That’s why they’d fitted the inside of
the vehicle with a projector, just like the

00:18:26.809 --> 00:18:32.770
one inside SCP-3114’s cell, to lure it back
into the trap.

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:39.240
Soon enough, just as Seward and all the others
had predicted, SCP-3115 began to angrily tear

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:42.590
off the rotten skin of the unfortunate store
clerk.

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:46.330
Its bones shone in the moonlight once more,
stained with blood.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.220
The next person it saw would be dead.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:54.120
So it was extremely lucky that the next person
it saw was the hologram of a male D-Class

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:59.039
standing deep in the back of the containment
vehicle’s portable cell.

00:18:59.039 --> 00:19:04.700
SCP-3114 sped towards the hologram, grasping
claws outstretched, so intent on getting its

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:09.279
new skin that it didn’t even notice the
bulkhead closing behind it.

00:19:09.279 --> 00:19:13.570
Agent Seward breathed a sigh of relief as
the vehicle drove off to the nearest containment

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:14.570
site.

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:18.210
But for him and the rest of his men, the night
had just begun.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:23.970
They still had a hell of a mess to clean up,
and all this just so that murderous skeleton

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:26.280
could have a Happy Halloween…

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:34.409
Now go check out “SCP-060 - Infernal Occult
Skeleton” and “SCP-1123 - Atrocity Skull”

00:19:34.409 --> 00:19:35.519
for more nightmarish anomalous bones!

